00:28:01.640 --> 00:28:05.440
fill the whole experience of going to the Emmys and the parties.
完整地体验一下参加艾美奖和各种派对的感觉。

521
00:28:05.720 --> 00:28:08.760
So yeah, I had sassy ponytail, leftover hair.
所以没错，我当时留着俏皮马尾，是前一天的发型。

522
00:28:09.180 --> 00:28:10.700
Well, that is amazing.
哇，那太棒了。

523
00:28:10.920 --> 00:28:11.960
And Angela, look at that.
还有安吉拉，你看那个。

524
00:28:12.040 --> 00:28:12.960
Your digital clutter.
你的数字杂物。

525
00:28:12.960 --> 00:28:15.040
It made it into this episode after all.
它最终还是出现在这一集里了。

526
00:28:15.140 --> 00:28:16.060
I snuck in.
我偷偷塞进去的。

527
00:28:16.060 --> 00:28:16.960
Well done.
干得好。

528
00:28:17.320 --> 00:28:18.040
Thank you.
谢谢。

529
00:28:18.660 --> 00:28:21.960
Well, I wanted to point something out in the background of this as well.
嗯，我也想指出这个场景背景里的一个东西。

530
00:28:22.200 --> 00:28:24.560
This is at 3 minutes, 13 seconds.
是在3分13秒的时候。

531
00:28:24.560 --> 00:28:32.760
Hence, the watercolor on the wall, it has been replaced with a photo of a golf course that
你看，墙上的水彩画被换成了一张高尔夫球场的照片，上面写着

