01:11:38.360 --> 01:11:42.220
get both feet down before they fall out of bounds.
出界前双脚落地。

1317
01:11:42.460 --> 01:11:44.140
Like you're like, how did they do it?
你会想，他们是怎么做到的？

1318
01:11:44.520 --> 01:11:54.520
He, while falling into the pool, whips our daughter around and places her gently on the side and
他在掉进泳池的同时，把我们的女儿甩了过去，轻轻地放在岸边，然后

1319
01:11:54.520 --> 01:11:57.820
then sort of falls backwards into the pool himself.
自己向后倒进了泳池里。

1320
01:11:57.820 --> 01:12:00.060
It's really incredible.
这真的很不可思议。

1321
01:12:00.440 --> 01:12:04.300
He saved her while falling himself.
他在自己掉落的同时救了她。

1322
01:12:05.560 --> 01:12:13.960
So I guess, I guess it's true, you know, in these moments, there's this instinctual part of you that
所以我猜，我想这是真的，你知道，在这些时刻，你内心有一种本能

1323
01:12:13.960 --> 01:12:15.000
just kicks in.
会瞬间爆发。

1324
01:12:15.000 --> 01:12:15.520
Yeah.
是啊。

1325
01:12:15.960 --> 01:12:23.880
